WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.888
This query groups admissions by month Inside each
SUM CASE

00:00:05.901 --> 00:00:12.008
contributes one when the row matches a selected
diagnosis and zero otherwise The

00:00:12.035 --> 00:00:17.864
sum becomes the diagnosis count for that month Run
the query and verify

00:00:17.891 --> 00:00:20.259
that each result row represents one month
